🎮 RED BLOOD - HOW TO PLAY & CONTROLS

============================================================
🎮 CONTROLS:
============================================================
🔴 Player 1 (Crimson Fighter)
  • Move Left / Right : A / D
  • Jump              : W
  • Attack (Blue Wind): E

🔵 Player 2 (Azure Phantom)
  • Move Left / Right : ← / → (Arrow Keys)
  • Jump              : ↑ (Up Arrow)
  • Attack (Red Wind) : 0 (Zero Key / Numpad 0)

⏸️ Match Pause
  • Press ESC at any time to open the Pause Menu!

🤖 Player vs AI Bot
  • Control Player 1 against the automated Azure Bot!
  • Adjust AI Bot difficulty (Easy / Normal / Hard) in Arena Settings.

============================================================
🌪️ ELEMENTAL WIND BLADES:
============================================================
  • Player 1 hurls piercing BLUE WIND blades.
  • Player 2 & AI Bot unleash flaming RED WIND blades.
  • Each wind strike hit deducts 1 HP from your opponent and triggers hit sparks!

============================================================
🏥 ARENA FEATURES & MEDKITS:
============================================================
  • Floating Rock Platforms: Jump up through platforms from below to gain tactical high ground.
  • Medkit Drops: Periodically drop on platforms. Touch a medkit to restore +3 HP!

============================================================
⚙️ ARENA SETTINGS:
============================================================
  • Audio Adjuster: Independent Volume sliders for Master, Music, and SFX.
  • Music & SFX Mute buttons: Quick one-click audio toggles in settings and pause menu.
  • Fighter Health: Choose 10 HP (Balanced), 15 HP (Extended), or 20 HP (Endurance).
  • Match Formats: Choose Best of 3, Best of 5, or Sudden Death (1 Round).
  • Screen Shake: Punchy camera impact feedback toggle.

============================================================
🏁 ROUNDS & VICTORY:
============================================================
  • Each player starts with 10 HP (or your configured HP tier).
  • Survive each round by depleting your rival's HP to 0.
  • Win the majority of rounds to become Champion!
